commit eb8ea283fdfc98a0d8a81ba0a60a416b2d5aa610

C03: the reviewed turn accepts a pending capture followed by its read (SCREEN1403)

«leéme lo que dice la pantalla» (H0038), «lee lo que hay en la pantalla» (H0709) and «leé lo que dice la pantalla» (H0616) plan capture.screenshot then ocr.read: the first step is the privacy-sensitive capture that needs the confirmation, the second is the read that binds the approved capture. MainWindowViewModel.ConductorConfirmationShape admitted only a single-step pending plan or a verified read prefix, so the reviewed turn could not capture that confirmation.

MainWindowViewModel.ConductorConfirmationShape: a two-step plan whose pending first step is capture.screenshot or capture.active.window and whose second step is ocr.read or vision.describe is a capturable confirmation; nothing else changes.

App recompiled (BUILD1403). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


